for it, instead of defaulting to a fixed engine/model that may not exist on the
machine. The auto-pick must stay overridable in the editor (keep the existing
engine/voice selectors). Once this lands, update the bundled panel applets --
the shipped starter worksheet panel-plugins/pipnode-xfce-applet/
pipnode-xfce-applet-default.json currently hard-codes an absolute
~/.local/share/piper/...onnx model path -- to rely on the auto-default so a new
